<title>FINLAND: Orion 1996 net sales, profit by division.</title>
<headline>Orion 1996 net sales, profit by division.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish pharmaceuticals group Orion-Yhtyma Oy on Friday gave the following breakdown of its 1996 net sales and operating profit by division (million markka):</p>
<p>    NET SALES		 1996	  1995     change (pct)</p>
<p> Orion Pharma		2,092	 2,011	   +4.0</p>
<p> Oriola			1,396	 1,270	   +9.9</p>
<p> Orion Diagnostica	   185	   201	   -8.1</p>
<p> Noiro			   469	   423	  +10.9</p>
<p> Normet			  177	   187	   -5.3</p>
<p> TOTAL			 4,283	 4,059	   +5.5</p>
<p>    OPERATING PROFIT	1996	  1995     change (pct)</p>
<p> Orion Pharma		  426	   413	   +3.1</p>
<p> Oriola			  143	   126	  +13.7</p>
<p> Orion Diagnostica	    18	    17	   +5.5</p>
<p> Noiro			    39	    34	  +15.4</p>
<p> Normet			   25	    31	  -18.4</p>
<p> Group items		   -19	   -25</p>
<p> TOTAL			   632	   596	   +6.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish pharmaceuticals group is Orion-Yhtyma Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 9 6805 0235</p>
</text>
